ing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time..."}]}}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Instructions: <span class=\"bullet\">Read the sentences.</span> <span class=\"bullet\">Type in the missing words.</span> <span class=\"bullet\">Choose from these words: <span class=\"product-color-text\">rather</span>, <span class=\"product-color-text\">apathetic</span>,  <span class=\"product-color-text\">said</span>."}], "type": "post_instructions"}, {"type": "template_override", "content": 2}]}, {"stimuli_ids": [], "template_override": 1, "questions": [{"responses": [{"correct": 0, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "id": 0, "selected": 0}, {"correct": 1, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "id": 1, "selected": 0}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "type": "question"}]}], "type": "RSLT", "id": 11, "_data": [{"contents": [], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Quiz"}], "type": "group"}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}, {"type": "text", "content": ""}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "Whoops! Something important is missing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time..."}]}}]}], "type": "scholar", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}], "type": "lab_options"}], "id": 0, "stimuli": [{"type": "welcome", "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "id": 0, "contents": [{}]}, {"contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"coverimg": "engenn6le14ob06re2img05.jpg", "audiosrc": "engenn6le14ob06re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "engenn6le14ob06re2img05.jpg", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"time": "100", "image": "engenn6le14ob06re2img05.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Renata</span>: Oh, I'm so glad to see you, Ferdinand. How was Miranda's meeting?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Ferdinand</span>: Too bad you couldn't make it. It gave me a lot to think about. Do you want an overview?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Renata</span>: Absolutely.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Ferdinand</span>: Miranda talked about greetings. She mostly related similarities in how North and South Americans greet each other but observed that North Americans may be less personable.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Renata</span>: What do you mean?"}, {"time": "25000", "image": "engenn6le14ob06re2img06.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Ferdinand</span>: Well, for example, Miranda said that North Americans may talk about the weather rather than asking about you specifically.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Renata</span>: Interesting.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Ferdinand</span>: Miranda told us things that worry me about my meeting with Janet.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Renata</span>: How so? You mean to say you were too personable?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Ferdinand</span>: Maybe not, but I was very emotional in my enthusiasm.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Renata</span>: I don't get it. Do you mean North Americans are apathetic about their jobs?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Ferdinand</span>: Oh no, but perhaps they show their interest by asking questions."}, {"time": "57000", "image": "engenn6le14ob06re2img07.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Renata</span>: Now I'm even more confused. Must you act like you don't know anything?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Ferdinand</span>: Oh, no. But Miranda said that showing too much emotion may come off as being insincere. Perhaps I seemed to be putting on a show. A North American might ask some questions in a serious tone to show that he is thoughtful rather than just excited.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Renata</span>: Oh, I get it. What else did she say? Did you do anything else wrong?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Ferdinand</span>: You mean you haven't heard? Wait until I tell you about me being late!"}]}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": []}]}]}